    "message": "feat: complete catalog host APIs and preserve publication retries (#171)\n\n* feat: expose checked catalog files for embedding hosts\n\n* test: account for macOS native ACL consumer dependencies\n\n* feat(productfiles): expose native private-file operations for hosts\n\n* feat(productfiles): expose identities for host recovery records\n\n* feat(productpaths): share workspace recovery file inventory\n\n* test: isolate Windows product path checks from private files package\n\n* feat: support versioned Starport acquisition credential policies\n\n* feat: resolve Starport catalog role secret references\n\n* test: qualify credential roles and reuse invocation evidence\n\n* test: require terminal credential refresh invalidation\n\n* test: register denied credential publication diagnostics\n\n* test: register managed credential acceptance contracts\n\n* test: register caller catalog disclosure acceptance\n\n* test: require endpoint membership redaction before cache access\n\n* test: require HTTP inference disclosure qualification\n\n* test: register catalog authority and identity lifecycle checks\n\n* test: require permission checks after queued dispatch\n\n* test: qualify official SDKs and authority startup contracts\n\n* test: register inference destination acceptance checks\n\n* test: register product path isolation acceptance\n\n* test: register HTTP catalog compatibility acceptance\n\n* test: register catalog view and in-flight acceptance\n\n* fix: accept TypeScript console acceptance tests\n\n* test: qualify batch admission and stream policy diagnostics\n\n* test(catalog): register indexed selection and retention contracts\n\n* test(catalog): qualify embedded selection and indexed discovery\n\n* test(catalog): cover exact route lookup allocation bounds\n\n* test(catalog): register advisory exchange acceptance cases\n\n* test(catalog): require renewal of unchanged peer health hints\n\n* feat(runtime): expose qualified permission clock to hosts\n\n* docs: align clock acceptance with operation contracts\n\n* test: register authorization load and mutation acceptance checks\n\n* test: register authorization request and recovery acceptance\n\n* test: register authorization dependency coherence\n\n* test: register separate-process authorization enforcement\n\n* test(catalog): register authorization working set qualification\n\n* test(catalog): register twelve cache behavior subcases\n\n* test(catalog): register cache kind enablement checks\n\n* test(catalog): register cache admission and semantic mode cases\n\n* test(catalog): register default memory qualification and scoped clock policy\n\n* test(product): require production discovery cache isolation\n\n* build(deps): bump github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/config in /\n\nBumps [github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/config](https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2) in `/` from 1.33.4 to 1.33.5.\n\n\nUpdates `github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/config` from 1.33.4 to 1.33.5\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/compare/config/v1.33.4...config/v1.33.5)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/config\n  dependency-version: 1.33.5\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: go_modules\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* build(deps): consolidate cloud authentication and storage updates\n\n* test: qualify public host file operations on native runners\n\n* docs: generate cached permission clock API reference\n\n* fix: retain completed catalog channels during receipt retry\n\n* fix: publish catalog completion receipt after legacy freshness\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
